## Gray Ooze

Gray oozes are eyeless and strike with limbs of themselves, and can hold what they catch. One kept the sewage works in the [[Geography/Færrin/Calaria/Hallia/Sewers|royal waterways]].

## Ochre Jelly

Ochre jellies are yellow, boneless oozes that lash out with limbs of themselves and hold what they catch. A blade cuts into one and it comes apart into two, and what is killed melts down to a puddle of water. They can throw a wash of acid over a room and lay a curse that ages a person for a moment.

## Living Tar

Living tar is a black ooze that usually hangs from ceilings but can move along the floor faster than its look suggests. A blade that strikes it sinks in and sticks, and it gathers loose rock into itself and throws it. The one that kept the sewage works in the [[Geography/Færrin/Calaria/Hallia/Sewers|royal waterways]] with the jellies is dead.

## Shoggoth

A shoggoth is a great black mass of ooze that pushes eyes and mouths up out of itself and lets them sink away again. It lashes out with limbs of itself, holds what it catches and crushes it. It can bore through a concrete floor or ceiling and be gone. It has no bone or organ to break, so it outlasts most of what is dealt it, and the sound it makes scrambles the senses of those nearby until they strike at whoever is closest. One came out of the books of the ruined Archive.

## Verdant Ooze

An ooze lives in the mid-boughs of the [[Verdant Expanse]] near where travellers enter from [[Geography/Færrin/Calaria/Wrenford|Wrenford]]. Its only sign is a faint, almost mucus-like residue left on the trees where it has passed. Nobody has yet seen what kind it is.
